---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: About
description: Learn about Solace Creations and how to connect.
---
<section class="container section">
  <h1>About {{ site.name }}</h1>
  <p>{{ site.description }}</p>
  <div class="note">
    <p><strong>Brand story placeholder:</strong> Replace this section with your Solace Creations story — what inspires your soaps, how they’re made, and what makes your products special.</p>
  </div>

  <h2 id="contact">Connect</h2>
  <p class="muted">Ordering is not live on this site yet. {{ site.orderingNote }}</p>
  <ul class="contact-list">
    {% if site.contact.email %}<li><strong>Email:</strong> {{ site.contact.email }}</li>{% endif %}
    {% if site.contact.instagram %}<li><strong>Instagram:</strong> {{ site.contact.instagram }}</li>{% endif %}
    {% if site.contact.facebook %}<li><strong>Facebook:</strong> {{ site.contact.facebook }}</li>{% endif %}
  </ul>
  {% if site.contact.note %}<p class="muted small">{{ site.contact.note }}</p>{% endif %}
</section>
